{"version":1,"key":"card:674","content":{"id":674,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在浏览器中，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"script","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"video","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"audio","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等标签引用跨域资源时，出于安全考虑，浏览器会将此资源视为不透明（Opaque），所谓的不透明通俗讲就是“只可远观而不可亵玩”，即脚本可以执行，图片可以显示，音视频可以播放，但是无法通过脚本获取到内容："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨域脚本无法计算 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":5141,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":675,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"integrity","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法验证资源完整性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"脚本执行报错也只能捕获到毫无意义的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"\"Script error.\"","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法获取到调用栈、行号等信息"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一旦将跨域图片通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"drawImage","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 画在 Canvas 上，此画布就会被标记为污染（tainted），而一旦画布收到污染，那么就无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getImageData","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取到画布内容，也无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"toDataURL","code":true},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"toBlob","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 导出为图片"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视频也是，如果尝试通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"drawImage","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将跨域视频的当前帧绘制到画布上，画布也会被标记为污染，无法获取到画布数据，也无法进行导出"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于跨域音频，也无法获取到二进制数据，无法进行音频分析，通过 Web Audio API 可以创建音频源，但是只能输出到扬声器，如果尝试输入到分析节点（AnalyserNode），得到的数据全部都是 0"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 发送请求时，可以将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mode","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"no-cors","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以发送跨域请求，但是此请求也是不透明的，即你会得到一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Response","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，但是无法通过此对象获取到任何有效信息"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"type: 'opaque'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"status: 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" (既不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"200","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"404","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，仅仅是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":")"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ok: false","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 你无法读取 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的任何文本或 JSON 数据"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"仅仅允许触发一个行为（例如埋点），但不允许窥探结果。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"crossorigin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性则是告诉浏览器按照 CORS 发送跨域请求，从而可以获取到资源的数据，这要求服务器能正确响应 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则连数据都获取不到，更别论读取数据了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"crsssorigin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的取值有两种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"anonymous","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：匿名模式，浏览器发送跨域请求，但不带 Cookie、客户端证书或 HTTP 认证信息，会发送 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求头，服务器需要配置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"use-credentials","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：凭证模式，浏览器发送跨域请求，并携带当前域下的 Cookie 、证书和用户凭证，服务器不仅需要配置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，还需要配置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true","code":true}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTML/crossorigin","安全/CORS"],"createTime":1769095750725,"updateTime":1775707558381,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775707558381},"links":{"card:675":{"key":"card:675","type":"card","id":675}}}